# std/money — 文の中から金額（円）を取り出す（use std/money）

action FindYen
  in       text text
  out      found number | missing
  example  "価格 ¥1,980"                    -> found 1980
  example  "送料は 500円 です"              -> found 500
  example  "￥３，３００（税込）"            -> found 3300
  example  "無料です"                       -> missing
  example  "1万円くらい"                    -> missing
  example  "本体 3,000円 / 税込 3,300円"    -> missing
  never    depend on width
  never    fail
  else     skip
  by       code "body/FindYen.lang"
